DATA SOURCE NOTICES
---------------------------------------------------------------------------

This software retrieves data from third-party public sources. The data itself
is subject to the terms of those sources, which are separate from this license:

* openFDA (U.S. Food and Drug Administration)
  Data is in the public domain under CC0 1.0. Attribution is requested but not
  required. Suggested citation:
      Data provided by the U.S. Food and Drug Administration (https://open.fda.gov)
  The FDA states this data is unvalidated and must not be used for medical
  decisions. FDA reserves the right to restrict access for usage that appears
  to exceed or circumvent documented rate limits.

* PubMed / NCBI E-utilities (U.S. National Library of Medicine)
  NLM's disclaimer and copyright notice must be evident to users of any product
  built on this data. PubMed abstracts may be protected by copyright;
  redistribution beyond fair use requires permission from the rights holder.
  NCBI does not permit scripting against its web pages — use E-utilities only.

* DailyMed (U.S. National Library of Medicine)
  Acknowledge NLM as the source. Do not use the PMC/DailyMed wordmarks or logos.
  Do not imply NLM or NIH endorsement.

Users of this software are responsible for complying with the terms of use of
each upstream data source.
